  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the technical potential of the State Revenue Committee in Kazakhstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative is a collaborative effort between Kazakhstan and its European partners to ensure compliance with the sanctions&#x2019; regime for High Priority List and dual-use goods transported across the state borders of the Republic of Kazakhstan. UNDP will utilize the contributions to purchase customs equipment, specific types of equipment will be determined by the donors in consultation with the State Revenue Committee of the Ministry of Finance of the Republic of Kazakhstan.</narrative>
  </description>
